'''Scavenger runts''' were a type of [[scavenger]] found in the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. They could be found in ruins and drop various items needed for puzzles and materials for skilling. Compared to [[scavenger beasts]], they dealt less damage and had fewer hitpoints, but they dropped two items when killed as opposed to three.

==Drops==
Scavenger runts dropped two items at a time.
